<title>UK: Thorn sees year profits broadly unchanged.</title>
<headline>Thorn sees year profits broadly unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>British electrical retailer Thorn Plc said on Monday that full year profits before tax and exceptionals will be broadly unchanged from last year's pro forma equivalent of 170.7 million stg.</p>
<p>It also said that profit before tax and exceptionals for the nine months ended December 31, 1996 was up eight percent on last year's pro forma to stand at 123.0 million stg.</p>
